<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰμαί-πῐτυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ground-pine, Ajuga Chamaepitys,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.681d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.158
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				24.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mountain germander, Teucrium montanum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>herbivy, Ajuga Iva,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
			</span></i> ll.cc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερικόν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.154
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρσίνη ἀγρία</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.144
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰμαιπῐτύϊνος</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span> wine <i>flavoured with one
				of these plants,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.70
			</span></i>.</div>
